@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205

### GET all registrations (paged)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### GET filter by type
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations?type=VIP&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### GET registration summary (KPI)
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations/summary
Accept: application/json

### POST duplicate plate number (409 Conflict)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Pedro Reyes",
  "contactNumber": "09181234567",
  "email": "pedro.reyes@example.com",
  "address": "789 Quezon Ave., Sorsogon City",
  "carMakeModel": "Nissan GT-R R35",
  "plateNumber": "TST 1001",
  "registrationType": "VIP",
  "amountPaid": 3500
}